<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTIA veia Pawluha Cayuk Anghngihnak</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk Anghngihnak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Timotia vei Pawluha cayuk anghngihnak</char> hin ani kuei lü ania kthaka dikia Timoti a khyang pum cun a mcuhmthehnak khawhah ngpüiki ni. Aktunga ta cuneinak ni. Timoti naw khuikhanak ja ktek khaihnak a hjawng üngpi evawnkelih pawh lü sajaa kba a mta cun pawh lü Cangcim phyüm ja Thankdaw akcang mtheinak cun kcüngei lü Jesuh Khritaw cun sitih lü a saksinak vaia kthape lü mcuhmthehnak ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aktunga Timoti cun “anghmawng ja ia am kyaki ngcuhngkaihnak” naw cungaikia khyange jah kpyak lü am jah dawsak lü kyühei phyaki ti cun mcäi lü käh a ngpüi hü vaia mawng ni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ahin avan üng, cayukia kcünsak ja a bünaka kyakie a jumeinak, a mlungmsaünak, a mhläkphyanak, a cuneinak ja mkhuimkhanak üng a khameinak cun a ngtheinak vaia sümsaki ni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mhlünmtainak ja Kthapetnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngthähnak ja mcäinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pawluh amäta vecawh <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Khritaw Jesuh am yümmatnak mi taka xünnak khyütam sang khaia tüih, Pamhnama hlüei Khritaw Jesuha ngsä Pawluh üngkhyüh ni,<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Ngs 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka mhlänak ka ca Timotia veia ni: Pa Pamhnam ja mi Bawipa Khritaw Jesuha bäkhäknak, mpyeneinak ja dim’yenak nang üng ning pe se.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mcäinak ja Jenak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Ka pupae naw ami na khüih khawia mäiha ngcimkia mät ja mät ksingnak am ka khüiha Pamhnama veia jenaka mthehki. Amhnüp amthan ka ktaiyünak üng ka ning süma phäh ani ka jenaki. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Na miktui ka süm üng, jekyainak am ka be vaia aktäa ka ning hmu hlüki. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Ngs 16:1</ref></char></note>Na nu Unick ja na pi Lawiha ami tak jumnaka ngkaw nang naw pi jumnak akcang na tak ka sümki. Nang naw pi acuna jumnak na taki tia ka ksingki. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Acunakyase, na khana ka kut ka mtai üng Pamhnam naw bänak a ning yet cän mphyünki lü na süm vaia ka ning mtheh be tüki ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Pamhnam naw a jah peta Ngmüimkhya naw am jah kyüheisak, acuna hnün üng Ngmüimkhya naw johit, mhläkphyanak ja mimät nängeinak am jah kbeki. <verse eid="2TI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Acunakyase, käh ngkeei lü mi Bawipa phäh saksia, Khritawa phäh thawng üng ka khyuma phäh pi käh ngkeeia. Pamhnam naw ngjuktha a ning peta mäiha Thangkdawa phäh khuikhanak khameia. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Ani naw jah küikyan lü a khyang vaia a jah khü hin mi bilawhnak üng am kya lüpi a bäkhäknak ja a mkhühnak am ni. Akcün am a tünei ham üng Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh a bäkhäknak jah peki. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Mi Küikyan Bawi Khritaw Jesuh a lawnak üng ahin cun mimia veia ngdang law pängki ni. Ahih naw thihnaka johit cän mkhyüh lü anglät xünnak cun thangkdaw üngkhyüh mdanki ni.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 2:7">1Tim 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Thangkdaw sang khai saja ja ngsäa Pamhnam naw na mcawn lü, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>ahinea phäh khuikha ka khamki ni. Lüpi mkhühüpnak ka taki, isetiakyaküng, u ka umnaki ti cun ka ksingki. Kei üng a na ap hüt cun Khawmhnüp a pha law vei cäpa ani naw säm khawhki tia ka ksingki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei üng i a na ap; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei naw ani üng i ka ap.</char></note>. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Khritaw Jesuh üng mi yümmatnaka kyaki mhläkphyanak ja jumeinak üng ve lü na läklama vai ka ning mtheia khyübe kcang cän kcüng kyet bä. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Mimi üng vekia Ngmüimkhya Ngcima johita khyüh a ning apa akdawe cän sämei kyet bä.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Asah hne veki khyang avan, Phakilas ja Hamawkines naw pi na cehtaki xawi ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bawipa mpyeneinak Onesiphoraha im kyawnga ve se, isetiakyaküng, ani naw akcün tä na jesaki ni. Thawng üng ka kyuma phäh pi am ngkeei lü, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Romah a pha law ja am a na hmuha küt üng kei na sui hüki ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Acuna Mhnüp üng Bawipa naw a bäkhäknak pe se! Keia phäha Epheta ihlawka biloki tia cän nami ksingkie ni.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Khritaw Jesuha sitihkia yekap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ka ca, nanga phäha Khritaw Jesuh am mi yümatnaka kyaki bäkhäknak üng ngkhängpanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Saksi khawhah maa ka pyena mtheimthangnak, na ngjaka mtheimthangnak he cän la lü khyang akce pi jah mthei be thei khaia khyange am jah ap siha.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Khritaw Jesuha sitihkia yekapa kba khuikhanak cän khameia. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Yekap cun naw ani mtheh lü ngthupeki angvai a jesak vaia akce bilawhnak üng kcaw lü i pi am bi khawi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Ngcamei lü dawngkia khyang naw pi mcuhmthenake am a jah läk üngta ngkhyengnak cun am yah khai ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Ngnüngseng lü lai biki naw akcüka a ah cun taeiki ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>I ka pyen ti hin ngaia, ahin avan na ksingnak vaia Bawipa naw khyaih khawhki ni.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Thangkdaw sang lü ka jah mtheia kba Davita mjüa kyaki thihnak üngkhyüh tho beki Jesuh Khritaw cän süma. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Isetiakyaküng, Thankdaw ka sanga phäha mpyukeia mäiha khunnak khamei lü ka khuikhaki ni. Lüpi Pamhnama ngthu cun khunnak am khamei thei, <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>acunakyase, angläta hlüngtainak law lü Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh lawkia küikyannak ami yah vaia phäha, anaküt hin Pamhnama xü khyangea phäha ka khamei ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ahin cun akcanga pyen ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Ani am mi thih üngta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">ani üng mi xüng khai.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mt 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Lk 12:9</ref></char>
    </note> Msu lü mi khamei üngta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ani am mi up hnga khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Ani mi ma üngta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">ani naw pi jah ma hnga khai.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Am mi sitih üngpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">ani cun sitih nglätki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">isetiakyaküng amät naw amät am hmakatsak thei.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khut biki ümpanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Ahina mcuhmthehnak hin na khyange am jah sümsak lü ngcuhngkaihnak vaia khyübe käh ami pawh vaia, Pamhnama maa jah mcäi kawm pi. Ahine naw am jah dawsak lü cungaikie jah pyaksaki ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Pamhnama ngthungtaka mawng cangkia jah mthei lü, khut biki naw a khut käh ngkeei lü, a pawha kba Pamhnama hmaia ümpanak na yah vaia na khyaih khawha pawha. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Pamhnam üngkhyüh jah thuksaki, khawmdek üng sängei lü am danga ngthähnake üngka naw akthuka vea. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Acunea mtheimthangnak hin naw mi pumsa jah eiawki mnehmnanga mäi ni a law ve. Himenias ja Philetuh xawi naw ahi bang jah mtheiki xawi ni.<verse eid="2TI 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Ani xawi naw ngthungtaka suilam hawih ni lü mi thawhnak be cun ve pängki ti lü jumeikie avanga jumeinak cun jah uplatsaki xawi ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Num 16:5</ref></char></note>Acunsepi, Pamhnam naw a taka ngkhängkia tüneinak lung cun am ngsünngkyet; hina ngthue cun acuna khana, “Bawipa naw a kae cun jah ksingki” cunkäna “Bawipa ka kanaki tikia khyang cun am dawki bilawhnak üngkhyüh nglat yah khai,” tia ng’yuki.<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Imnua k'uma kbee ja k’ame amjü küm veki: avang cun ngui ja xüi am ami jah pyan, akcee cun thing ja mdek am ami jah pyan, avang cun pawipyang üng jah sumei lü avang cun ami jah sumei sawxat ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Akse üngkhyüh amimät ngcimsaki cun adawnaka hnün üng sumei khaie, isetiakyaküng, ami mahpa naw akdaw jah pawhnak vaia jah sumei lü ami ngapei vaia ngsäm yah khaie ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Cawngpyanga hlükaweinak cän hawih lü ngsungpyunnak, jumeinak, mhläkphyanak ja dim’yenak, mlungkyawng ngcimki he am atänga Bawipaa kpüinak yah vaia ngkhüngkonake cän jah mtuneia. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Ngtunngvawknak üng jah kphakia amdang ngcuhngkaihnak ja am ngtähngkehkia ngkaw üngkhyüh akthuka vea. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Bawipaa mpyaa na kyaka mäiha nang naw ngtunngvawknak am pawh yahki. Nang cun khyang daw ja a mlungmsaüki sajaa kba khyang naküta vei na daw yah khai. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Nang cun ning ngcam püiki na mtheh üng na hniphnawi yah khai, ahin cun Pamhnama hlüeia kya lü ami cun ngjut be lü ngthungtak cun ksing law khai ni. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Khawyai naw ani kcangnak khaia a jah pinmane cun lätlang law u lü akdawkyaa ksing law khaie ni.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka mhnüpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Akpäihnaka mhnüpe üng akhaknaka kcüne ve law khai ti cun süma. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Khyange naw amimäta nghmah bük khaie, ngui hlüei khaie, awhcah khaie, khyanga thang mset khaie, mäta phäh tengnak, nupaa pyen kpet khaie, dawkyanak am ksing u lü ningsaw pi am ksing u, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>amimi cun am dawkya u, mpyeneinak am ve, khyang aksea pyen khaie, hlühlawk u lü sosat khaie; akdaw cun am hmu hlü u, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>ami cun am sitih u, cungaihnak pi am ve, awhcah u lü Pamhnama kthaka bawimangnak jawngnakie; <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>mi ningsaw akpung sawxat läklam u lü johit kcang cun mah khaie. Acuna khyange üngkhyüh akthuka vea. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Khyang avange cun khyangea ima cit hü u lü ktha ngceki nghnumie, ami mkhyea ja hlükawei naw a jah nängeie naküt cun jah hnepei hükie ni, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>acun nghnumie cun ngthungtak am ksing u lüpi ngthei khaia angläta kthanakie ni.<verse eid="2TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:11">Ex 7:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Janneh ja Jambareh naw Mosi ami ngtek püia kba ahina khyange naw pi ngthungtak ngtek püikie-ahinea mlung cun thi lü jumeinak üngpi ngsukngvänkie ni. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Khyang avan naw ihlawka yüangkie ti cun ami jah ksinga phäh akthuk am pha khawh u. Acukba kunga Janneh ja Jambareha veia thawnki.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnak mcäinake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Nang naw ta, ka vecawh, ka mtheimthang ja ka kcün sak üng ka mkhühnak; ka jumnak, ka mlung msaünak, ka mhläkphyanak, ka khameinak, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Ngs 13:14-52</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:1-7">Ngs 14:1-7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:8-20">Ngs 14:8-20</ref></char></note>ami na mkhuimkhanake ja ka khuikhanake. Khyühkyawk vaia mkhuimkhanake hin Antiok, Ikonih ja Luhtaraha thawnki ti cun na jah ksingki ni. Lüpi Bawipa naw na yungkaihki ni. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>A u pi, Khritaw Jesuh am yümmat lü akdawa xüng hlüki ta mkhuimkhanak khamei lü, <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>khyang ksee ja khyang k’hleie cun akse üngkhyüh akse bawk pawh u lü khyange jah mhlei u lü amimät naw amimät mhlei sihki he ni. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Acun sepi, nang ta, angkhänga jumki lü na ngthei ja ngthungtak am msu lü vea. Na sajae u tia ksingki lü, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Ngcimkia Cangcim na dik ham üngkhyüh na ksingki, acun naw kthemnak jah pe lü acuna kthemnak naw Khritaw Jesuh jumnak üngkhyüh küikyannak da jah cehpüiki ti cun süm bä. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Cangcim naküt hin Pamhnama xünsaka kya lü <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cangcim naküt hin Pamhnama xünsaka kya lü dawki; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pamhnama xünsak Cangcim naküt hin dawki.</char></note>ngthungtak jah mtheinak, akhye jah mthehnak, hmaki pitpyannak ja akdawa xün vaia jah mcuhmthehnaka dawki ni, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>acunakyase, Pamhnama khut pawhkia khyang cun Cangcim üngkhyüh akdaw amjü mjü bilawhnak khawh am kbebangki ni.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Khritaw Jesuh ja Pamhnam naw akthi ja akxüng üng ngthu jah mkhyah khai, isetiakyaküng, ani cun sangpuxanga kba jah up law khaia hmaia ka ning mtheh ta, <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>mlung msaünak am na jah mtheia kba jah ksingsak lü mkhye jah mtheh lü ktha jah petnak üng (akcün ve lüpi kyase akcün am a ve üng pi kyase) ngthu cun pyen lü na sang vai ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Khyange naw akdawa ningsaw am cungaihnak vai kcün pha law lü amimäta hlükawei cun läk u lü ami hnga a ngjak'hlünak bawk vaia jah mtheikia sajaea vei ngkhäm hü khaie ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Ngthungtak cungaihnak nglata u lü khüikama ngkhawe cun ngai law hlü khaie. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Lüpi nang ta a i naküt üng namät cän mceiei lü khuikhanak cunei lü Thangkdaw sangki sajaa khut pawh lü na mta naküt cän Pamhnama mpyaa kba khüikhawma.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Keia phäha ta, ka ngapei vaia kcün pha law hnühki; ahina sak ka cehta law hnüh khai ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Ka jumnak ta lü akthuka dawnnak vai üng ka khyaih khawha ka dawng pängki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jumnak ta lü </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ka khyütam üng kcang lü.</char></note> <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Tukbäih ta keia phäh Pamhnam am ngsungpyunnaka ngnängnaka ngkhyengnak (Pamhnam am ngsungpyunnak) naw na k'äihki. Acun cun Bawipa, ngsungpyunkia Ngthumkhyahki naw acuna Mhnüp üng kei däk am kya lü ani angdannak law vai mhläkphyanak am k'äihki üngpi jah pe khai ni.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluha khyübe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Akjanga ka veia na law vaia ktha na bä. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phil 24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Kal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit 1:4</ref></char></note>Demah naw khawmdek kphyanakia kyase Thesalonikah da kei na cehtaki. Crescens Kalatih da cit lü Tihtuh Dalamatiha citki. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phil 24</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Ngs 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phil 24</ref></char></note>Luhka däk ni ka hlawnga a ve. Makuh cän khü lü ka veia law püia, isetiakyaküng, ani naw ka khut na kpüi khai ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ngs 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Eph 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char></note>Taikikah cun Epheta ka tüih ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Ngs 20:6</ref></char></note>Na law üng, Tarosa mlüh, Kaphus ima ka tak hüt kcuawh cän law lü ka caupe ja ca ka yuknak mehvun nglepe pi jah law bä.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Tim 1:20</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sal 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char>
    </note>Mthiksep Aleksanda naw aktäa na mkhuimkhakia kyase a bilawha kba Bawipa naw thung be khai. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Ani cän mceiei lü ve bä, isetiakyaküng, mi ngthu aktäa am jah kcangnakki ni.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Kamät akcüka ka ng’yungei üng kei da upi am ve, avan naw na cehtak päihkie. Pamhnam naw ami bilawh käh jah kheh pe se! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Bawipa ka hlawnga veki lü ngjuktha na pekia kyase kkeia mpyawng üngkhyüh pi na yung lü khyangmjükce vana ngjak vaia ngthu avan cun ka sang khawhki. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bawipa naw akse naküt üngkhyüh na yung lü a khankhaw pea kei cun üpawmkia na cehpüi khai. Ani üng hlüngtainak angläta ve se! Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Ngs 18:2</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2Tim 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Priscilah ja Akuilah, Onesiphoraha imkyawng lawnge na jah hnukset pet bä. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Ngs 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ngs 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref></char></note>Eratuh cun Korintuh mlüha vehüt lü Throphimah ta Miletuha ka hawih hüt ni, isetiakyaküng, ani cun am khyaiheiki ni. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Khawksik khya apha hlana na law vaia mtunei bä.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Eubulas, Puden, Linas ja Kalawdih ja Khritjan akcee naw pi ning hnukset ve u.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bawipa na ngmüimkhyaa hlawnga ve se. Pamhnama bäkhäknak nami vana khana ve se.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
